  "contentHtml": "<p>안드로이드폰의 motion shot 과 동일한 다중섬광사진을 찍을 수 있는 아이폰 앱이 있어서 학생들과 사용했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #3c4043;\">앱스토어에서 &quot;actshot&quot; 으로 검색하여 설치하시면 됩니다. (액션시퀀스샷)</span><br><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/action-sequence-shot/id1223441158\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/action-sequence-shot/id1223441158</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"&#8206;Action Sequence Shot\" data-og-description=\"&#8206;Simple action sequence photo maker APP !! [How to use] 1. Take slow motion video with your iPhone. 2. Load video. 3. Tap auto-capture button. That's all!! Continuous motion is automatically synthesized in one photo. Let's create cool and amazing action \" data-og-host=\"apps.apple.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/action-sequence-shot/id1223441158\" data-og-url=\"https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/action-sequence-shot/id1223441158\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ftq53/hyOdDuRJ4F/VKHmR65RcEUf37wc1KenK1/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/R48XI/hyOdvXTGdO/4fGSZKb188AkKNyi9T4sg0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/action-sequence-shot/id1223441158\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/action-sequence-shot/id1223441158\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ftq53/hyOdDuRJ4F/VKHmR65RcEUf37wc1KenK1/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/R48XI/hyOdvXTGdO/4fGSZKb188AkKNyi9T4sg0/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1200_600\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">&#8206;Action Sequence Shot</p><p class=\"og-desc\">&#8206;Simple action sequence photo maker APP !! [How to use] 1. Take slow motion video with your iPhone. 2. Load video. 3. Tap auto-capture button. That's all!! Continuous motion is automatically synthesized in one photo. Let's create cool and amazing action </p><p class=\"og-host\">apps.apple.com</p></div></a></div><p>사용방법을 안내한 pdf파일을 첨부합니다. 그렇게 어렵지 않아서 금방 사용할 수 있으실 것입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1dc424541fba5baf920df09f7c10ac917f98a606?download\" data-file-name=\"액션시퀀스샷 사용방법(2024).pdf\" data-file-size=\"526757\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D610%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20220430182831&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1dc424541fba5baf920df09f7c10ac917f98a606')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">액션시퀀스샷 사용방법(2024)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">514.41KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
